","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"中尉","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m024-0067","usage":"narrative","date_expression":"漢孝文皇帝十四年","normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":166,"year":-165,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"漢孝文皇帝十四年，匈奴單于十四萬騎入朝那、蕭關，殺北地都尉卬，虜人民畜產甚多，遂至彭陽。使奇兵入燒回中宮，候騎至雍甘泉。於是文帝以中尉周舍、郎中令張武爲將軍，發車千乘，騎十萬，軍長安旁以備胡寇。而拜昌侯盧卿爲上郡將軍，甯侯魏遬爲北地將軍，隆慮侯周灶爲隴西將軍，東陽侯張相如爲大將軍，成侯董赤爲前將軍，大發車騎往擊胡。單于留塞內月餘乃去，漢逐出塞即還，不能有所殺。匈奴日已驕，歳入邊，殺略人民畜產甚多，雲中、遼東最甚，至代郡萬餘人。漢患之，乃使使遺匈奴書。單于亦使當戶報謝，復言和親事。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p024","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/110.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《資治通鑑》卷十五數位編輯紀年標題","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷015&oldid=1151616","quote":"文帝前十四年（乙亥，公元前一六六年）","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"本段漢孝文皇帝十四年按前元十四年換前166年、天文年-165，只記年尺度。所參照公元年份為數位編輯紀年標題，不作古代正文；未以後續歲入邊敘事補所有事件年份。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"以及拜、為明示授任另存；原有爵號與官職只記本次用稱年，不推始封或原職起年。不採本紀異職名覆寫本篇，終止未知。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji110-052","person_id":"3u2_btf_ob4","title":"將軍","kind":"office","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p024","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/110.json"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji110-052:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p024","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"將軍","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m024-0067","usage":"narrative","date_expression":"漢孝文皇帝十四年","normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":166,"year":-165,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provi